  "description": "Nalix.Environment provides the essential bootstrap infrastructure for the Nalix ecosystem. It coordinates system environment discovery, secure filesystem preparation (Unix-compatible permissions), and high-performance configuration loading. By decoupling environment-specific logic and settings binding from the core execution engine, it ensures a reliable and predictable startup sequence for Nalix-based servers and applications.",
  "iconFile": "nalix.png",
